  Requirements: 
    PHP4 with XML support
    a web-browser (doh!)
                
  Summary:
   xmltree creates a hierarchical tree menu from an XML file.
    Currently xmltree can:
     * Have an unlimited depth of nodes
     * Each leaf node may have its own image type assigned
     * Collapsable and Expandable branches
     * Each node can has its own name
     * Each node can include a link for any other document with a target type(ie _new)
     * Maintains all expanded/collapsed nodes on use
     * All additional XML data is available for all nodes
     
